    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time puzzle gameplay with stealth elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your hacking tool and robot companions to evade the enemies and outsmart an evil AI that has corrupted your facility and wants to put you back to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party members with unique personalities and skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a party of distinct robots with unique abilities and take control of them to compensate for your own deteriorating body. Recruit the functional and barely functional models you encounter to follow your lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark and atmospheric post-human world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a sci-fi adventure in a world where artificial minds have taken over. Navigate the dysfunctional societies they developed in your absence and take a moment to reflect on your own responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multilayered emotionally-charged story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with topics such as post-humanism, automatization and narcissism through dialogues, flashbacks, hidden logs and cutscenes. Uncover and interpret the mistakes of the past and choose how the story ends.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time puzzle gameplay with stealth elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your hacking tool and robot companions to evade the enemies and outsmart an evil AI that has corrupted your facility and wants to put you back to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/faaded2062805eebe211008b7a99cf31.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party members with unique personalities and skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble a party of distinct robots with unique abilities and take control of them to compensate for your own deteriorating body. Recruit the functional and barely functional models you encounter to follow your lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/7aa2e905653bb503f295776a80cd3301.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark and atmospheric post-human world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a sci-fi adventure in a world where artificial minds have taken over. Navigate the dysfunctional societies they developed in your absence and take a moment to reflect on your own responsibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.poster.avif?t=1734435962\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.webm?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145980/extras/99c1fc0827bb454ba09a02ea0b5c2c6c.mp4?t=1734435962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multilayered emotionally-charged story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage with topics such as post-humanism, automatization and narcissism through dialogues, flashbacks, hidden logs and cutscenes. Uncover and interpret the mistakes of the past and choose how the story ends.</p>",
